# Per-Dockerfile ignore（BuildKit：与本 Dockerfile 同目录，路径相对 build context 根）。
# context = workspace 根（同时含 deepseek-harness/ 与 minecraft-ai-friend/），
# 用「排除一切 + 白名单放行」把 context 传输量压到最小（工作区里其他东西一律不进）。
*
!deepseek-harness
deepseek-harness/*
!deepseek-harness/vendor
!deepseek-harness/packages
!minecraft-ai-friend
minecraft-ai-friend/node_modules
minecraft-ai-friend/data
minecraft-ai-friend/mc-server
minecraft-ai-friend/docs
minecraft-ai-friend/sidecar
minecraft-ai-friend/.git
minecraft-ai-friend/.gitignore
minecraft-ai-friend/*.log*
minecraft-ai-friend/test-*.mts
minecraft-ai-friend/test-*.py
minecraft-ai-friend/*.bat
minecraft-ai-friend/check_panel.cjs
minecraft-ai-friend/analyze-skill-usage.mts
minecraft-ai-friend/passive-e2e.mts
minecraft-ai-friend/magic-test.mjs
minecraft-ai-friend/rcon-test.mts
minecraft-ai-friend/ritual-test.mts
minecraft-ai-friend/Dockerfile*
minecraft-ai-friend/docker-compose.yml
minecraft-ai-friend/deploy-server.mjs
minecraft-ai-friend/start_webpanel.py
minecraft-ai-friend/setup-vendor-links.mjs
